@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. One tool: GetOrderStatus(123)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{ "question": "Where's my order 123?" }

### 2. Two tools in a row: GetRecentOrders() → GetOrderStatus(124)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{ "question": "Where's my last order?" }

### 3. A different tool: GetReturnPolicy("shoes")
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{ "question": "Can I return shoes after 40 days?" }

### 4. Cancel, step 1: the model calls RequestCancelOrder(124) → nothing cancelled yet
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{ "question": "Cancel order 124" }

### 5. Cancel, step 2: the user clicks "Yes, cancel" → now it's cancelled
POST {{host}}/api/chat/cancel/124/confirm
X-User-Id: alice

### 6. Someone else's order → "not found"
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{ "question": "Where's my order 456?" }
